# Code quality

| # | Rule |
|---|------|
| E1 | No `any`. Prefer `unknown` + type guards. Exhaust discriminated unions. |
| E2 | Prettier + ESLint enforced. 2-space indent. Run format/lint on touched files before commit. |
| E3 | `npm run typecheck` (or `npx tsc -p tsconfig.build.json --noEmit`) must pass before any PR. |
| E4 | Unit-test new pure logic (schemas, workflows, presenters) with Jest. Controllers stay thin. |

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
function parse(input: any) { return input.id; }

// ✅ GOOD
function parse(input: unknown): string {
  if (typeof input !== 'object' || input === null || !('id' in input)) {
    throw new BadRequestException('Invalid payload');
  }
  const id = (input as { id: unknown }).id;
  if (typeof id !== 'string') throw new BadRequestException('Invalid id');
  return id;
}
```
